cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you cite this analysis, please cite it as below, and cite Stats NZ
  separately as the source of the underlying data.
title: "Where New Zealand's sheep went: a regional breakdown of the flock decline, 2002-2025"
abstract: >-
  A regional reconciliation of the New Zealand sheep flock decline using Stats
  NZ table AGR_AGR_003, with suppression-aware handling, validation rules
  exercised against a deliberately corrupted copy, and a published Quarto
  report rebuilt by CI. The code is MIT; the extract in data-raw/, the derived
  outputs and the report's text and figures are CC BY 4.0. See DATA-LICENCE.md.
authors:
  - family-names: Jiang
    given-names: Feng
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-23
repository-code: https://github.com/Kenchch/nz-sheep-decline-by-region
url: https://kenchch.github.io/nz-sheep-decline-by-region/
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
references:
  - type: data
    title: "Agricultural production statistics: livestock numbers by regional council (AGR_AGR_003)"
    authors:
      - name: Stats NZ
    license: CC-BY-4.0
    url: https://explore.data.stats.govt.nz
    date-accessed: 2026-09-04
